Ascend/catlass/README.md:   23│ - [2026/06] [v1.6.0](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/releases/v1.6.0) 发布：新增 [**MXFP8 / MXFP4 量化模板**](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/examples/53_ascend950_fp8_mx_matmul/README.md)、[**EVG 声明式后处理框架**](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/examples/64_ascend950_matmul_evg/README.md)、[**基于 Mutex 同步原语的 BlockMmad**](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp)；新增 [Ascend950 Tile 层组件](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/tree/v1.6.0/include/catlass/gemm/tile/ascend950) 及全量 [单元测试](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/tests/unittest/catlass/gemm/tile/README.md)；新增 [算子级测试框架（optest）](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/tests/optest/README.md)；新增 16 个**Ascend950**算子样例（如 [StreamK Matmul](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/examples/66_ascend950_streamk_matmul/README.md)、[Flash Attention Chunk Prefill](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/examples/70_ascend950_flash_attention_chunk_prefill/README.md)、[Conv2d](https://gitcode.com/cann/catlass/blob/v1.6.0/examples/56_ascend950_basic_conv2d_tla/README.md) 等）。
